        {
            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for getting to this so quickly. I completely understand the performance concerns. Really my hope was mainly to use `hl_eol` but I could imagine also enjoying `hl_mode`, `virt_lines`, and `sign_text` as I think they fit nicely in the scope of `hipatterns`. ",
