        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "This is a part of `main` branch.\r\n\r\nHere is a dummy example of how to highlight whole line with a match at its start:\r\n\r\n```lua\r\nlocal zero_indent_extmark_opts = function(_, _, data)\r\n  return { hl_group = 'Visual', end_row = data.line, end_col = 0, hl_eol = true, right_gravity = false }\r\nend\r\n\r\nrequire('mini.hipatterns').setup({\r\n  highlighters = {\r\n    zero_indent = { pattern = '^%S', group = '', extmark_opts = zero_indent_extmark_opts },\r\n  }\r\n})\r\n```\r\n\r\nThanks for the push to make this! This ended up a nice increase in functionality.",
